# Performance and SEO

Public pages should ship a static shell. Cache marketing UI with `use cache` and `cacheLife`. Leave the lead action dynamic. Do not import client-only libraries into a page that can stay a Server Component.

## Images and metadata

- Use `next/image` with explicit `width` and `height`, or a known `fill` parent. `priority` is only for the hero.
- Founder photos live in `public/` or an allowed remote host. Write a specific `alt` that names the person.
- Export `metadata` or `generateMetadata` from the page. Set `title.absolute` or a root title template, a unique description, canonical, and `alternates.languages` for the Spanish foreclosure page.
- Add `app/sitemap.ts` and `app/robots.ts` once real routes exist.

## JSON-LD

Render JSON-LD in the Server Component. Escape `<` so the script cannot break out of the tag.

```tsx
<script
  type="application/ld+json"
  dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{
    __html: JSON.stringify(jsonLd).replace(/</g, "\\u003c"),
  }}
/>
```

Use `LocalBusiness` on the home and contact pages, and `FAQPage` only for questions that are visible in the FAQ.
